{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pulls/264","id":4911667662,"node_id":"PR_kwDORoMukM8AAAABJMIZzg","html_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pull/264","diff_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pull/264.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pull/264.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/issues/264","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pulls/264/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pulls/264/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/issues/264/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/statuses/b978b44f10524a42407df2866dff7b4711d14e38","number":264,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(marketplace): preserve intent and acceptance coverage","user":{"login":"ranzuozhou","id":35538471,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTM4NDcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35538471?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou","html_url":"https://github.com/ranzuozhou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"当前候选为 `b978b44f10524a42407df2866dff7b4711d14e38` / tree `68b2923eadb39c17466a1576bbfdd4995b682b1f`。2026-10-19 按后续授权普通同步最新 develop `e3ffecf4`，解决新增 CHANGELOG 条目的冲突并保留双方历史；#257 的接受范围不延伸至本任务。独立同步保真核对与本机 597/597（零失败/跳过）及 validate 通过，新 head Windows/Ubuntu/A6/结构检查已全部通过，Windows 597/597、十三安装通过；旧 head 的 CI 不沿用。当前真实非作者批准仍为0，尚未受保护合入。\n## 问题与结果\n需求在实施中容易丢失原始含义，或把文档状态、工程通过和业务接受混为一谈。本变更新增正式 INTENT 类型与唯一正本机制，固定完整接受基线，以逐项覆盖连接工程范围、验收与实际结果。\n\n兼容最新 develop 的 canonical/working、PLAN/REPORT 和 source bindings；正式 INTENT 为九个公共字段加 intent-id，保留 draft/active/deprecated/archived 身份。复用现有 20 项开发技能；不新增公开技能或改变插件、版本、兼容 pin。\n\n## 成品入口\n- [任务 INDEX](https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/blob/codex/intent-mechanism/plans/263-intent-mechanism/INDEX.md)\n- [完整接受与实施 PLAN](https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/blob/codex/intent-mechanism/plans/263-intent-mechanism/%5BPLAN%5D_Intent_Mechanism.md)\n- [验收 REPORT](https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/blob/codex/intent-mechanism/plans/263-intent-mechanism/%5BREPORT%5D_Intent_Mechanism.md)\n- [INTENT 规范](https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/blob/codex/intent-mechanism/docs/rule/%5BSTANDARD%5D_AI_Engineering_Intent.md)\n\n完整 B1、Q1–Q6、原始请求、七原则及集中授权均以可恢复快照保存，逐件绑定准确字节；这是可见文字捕获，不声称宿主原始导出。新 INT-2026-001 整理稿诚实保留 draft，未冒充另一次逐字接受；实施依据仍是已接受完整 B1 与后续授权。\n\n## 实现与验证\n- 类型、十字段、五部分正文、稳定 ID、索引、正式全集合唯一性及读取完整性纳入严格 Harness/CI。单文件检查仍扫描全正式集合；退役/归档身份保留，声明逃逸、来源及快照篡改失败关闭。\n- 既有 intake、文档、计划、自检、交付模板和根指令已连接原意、接受、操作授权与覆盖关系；机器成功不能代替真实决定。\n- 最终功能组合通过 597 项测试、零失败/跳过；十三次精确隔离安装、实际安装缓存六次 Diagram Python 和十八次 Learning Evidence 操作通过，Codex 0.147.0。每项证据绑定各自实际 source/head/tree，较早 595 项和后续证据改动未相互追认。\n- 独立 Agent 按预先冻结 INTENT-IA-R1 核验八个限定场景；五角色模拟是同一 Agent 上下文续跑，并非五个 fresh CLI。另有实际 22 探针、4 CLI 负例、16 次固定源码实读；106 份原件、149 份来源绑定、133 条归档记录逐件核验。\n- 最终候选实际隔离投影恢复 149 份快照并回读字节一致，正本身份全集合检查通过；见 [最终候选闭包与独立集成回执](https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pull/267#issuecomment-6253938146)。\n\n原六项探针失败、依赖失败、CLI 模型环境阻断、R1 读取证据不足、两项评审断言勘误、CRLF staging 与指令预算失败及真实重跑均保留，未删除失败或放宽验收标准。\n\n## 集成与保护\n本 PR 是 Epic #263 唯一活动主 PR，codex/intent-mechanism → develop。三个子 PR #266（Harness）、#265（合同）及 #267（验收证据）均指向无保护的集成分支，内部检查和独立核验后由 Agent 合并；实际合并为 #266 e349fef8、#265 e0267401、#267 ae27cf4d；该批次 tree 92bf20ad 与已测 fb7f6e79 完全一致。精确 SHA/tree 及收尾复验见本 PR 和 Epic 的操作回执。\n\ndevelop 严格遵守实际 ruleset：最新 base、Validate Structure、A6 / Check、当前 head 非作者/last-push 批准和已解决线程。不 bypass、不指定审查人；独立 Agent 验收不冒充 GitHub 保护批准。\n\n## 限制与恢复\n原生未答窗口持续显示尚未实证，相关入口延期，未提交/默认/预选/超时/关闭不算答复；本次不新增独立访谈入口。真实长期业务效果 NOT_RUN，Owner 最终成品接受另记。核心技术交付、受保护合并、全计划、原意实际结果及最终接受各自判断；Epic 保留未完成事项。\n\n通过隔离 worktree、可追溯纠正提交/PR 恢复；原始用户工作区改动保持。无 main 发布、tag、Release、保护规则修改或版本升号。\n\n## 自检\n- [x] 完整接受基线及授权可恢复\n- [x] 严格实现、模板、技能和文档入口同步\n- [x] 独立合成验收及原失败留档\n- [x] 字节绑定与实际投影恢复通过\n- [ ] 当前成品 head 的 develop 保护批准/CI/线程及实际合并复验\n- [ ] Owner 最终成品接受与延期入口补验\n\nRefs #263\n\n实际合并、最终来源恢复与独立保护核验的唯一操作回执：[成品交付回执](https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pull/264#issuecomment-6254091839)。主 PR 尚未合入 develop；保护批准与主 PR 运行中矩阵按回执时点分别记录。","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-18T18:28:51Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T01:52:13Z","closed_at":"2026-10-19T01:52:13Z","merged_at":"2026-10-19T01:52:12Z","merge_commit_sha":"be4024353155ebaad8301dba8a9949666d376877","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"MJ-AgentLab:codex/intent-mechanism","ref":"codex/intent-mechanism","repo":{"id":1183002256,"node_id":"R_kgDORoMukA","name":"mj-agentlab-marketplace","full_name":"MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace","owner":{"login":"MJ-AgentLab","id":262496159,"node_id":"O_kgDOD6Vfnw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262496159?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJ-AgentLab","html_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJ-AgentLab/fol